  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nLet us analyze each option:\n\nGiven: 56 – 8 + 42 ÷ 6 × 5 = 19\n\ni) – and ×\n\n⇒ 56 × 8 + __**42 ÷ 6**__ – 5 = 19\n\n⇒ **__56 × 8__** + 7 - 5 = 19\n\n⇒ __**448 + 7**__ - 5 = 19\n\n⇒** __455 - 5__**\n\n= 450 ≠ 19\n\nii) + and –\n\n⇒ 56 + 8 – __**42 ÷ 6**__ × 5 = 19\n\n⇒ 56 + 8 – **__7 × 5__**\n\n⇒ **__56 +__****__ 8__** – 35 \n\n⇒ **__64 – 35__** \n\n= 29 ≠ 19\n\niii) ÷ and –\n\n⇒ **56 ÷ 8** + 42 – 6 × 5 = 19\n\n⇒ 7 + 42 – __**6 × 5**__ = 19\n\n⇒ **__7 + 42__** - 30 \n\n= __**49 - 30**__ = 19\n\niv) + and ÷ \n\n⇒ 56 – **__8 ÷ 42__** + 6 × 5 \n\n⇒ 56 – 0.19 + __**6 × 5**__\n\n⇒ **__56__** - 0.19 __**+ 30**__ \n\n⇒ __**86 - 0.19**__\n\n= 85.81 ≠ 19\n\nHence,** '÷ and ****–'** is the correct answer.",
